  "notes": [
    "Tellyclub's widgets, broken OUT as sub-apps (owner's direction, July 2026) rather than reachable only from inside the running TV. The channel guide is the first: tvp's hash router gained `#guide`, so this is the same app booted straight into its EPG. More of tellyclub's internal widgets (controller, venues) can follow the same pattern — each is one hash route in tvp plus one line here."
